// Recorded from the same real PDM 1.1.10 after its servers were renamed: remotes
// pve-a, pve-b, pve-backup, pve-lab (PVE) and pve-backup-pbs (PBS), plus each node's
// network, each guest's config (reduced to name, hostname, net* and ipconfig*) and the RRD history
// of nodes, running guests and the datastore (reduced to the fields read). Scrubbed: guest
// names, hostnames and backup comments, public addresses (to 203.0.113.0/24), fingerprints, MAC
// addresses; SSH keys and cloud-init users are never kept. Remote and node names are examples,
// and private addresses are moved to 10.0.0.0/16 keeping which ones repeat across remotes. A
// storage name that encoded an address is now `backup-offsite`. VMIDs and backup ids are mapped
// and times moved exactly as in recorded-pdm.ts.

